{"id":"407758cb4b596714","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-game2-rank-game.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Rank Game","display":"df-zfc-game2-rank-game — ZFC Game2 Rank Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-rank-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-rank-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-rank-game — ZFC Game2 Rank Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-tree]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-well-founded]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-rank-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-rank-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-rank-game — ZFC Game2 Rank Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"58-df-well-founded\">58-df-well-founded</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\prec_T)\">\\((T,\\prec_T)\\)</span> (well-founded game tree; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in V\">\\(r\\in V\\)</span> (rank-function graph candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RankGame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RankGame}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}rank\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2RankGame}_S(r,T,\\prec_T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}(T,\\prec_T)\\land\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(\\{\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\},T)\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,T,\\alpha)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(r(s)=\\sup\\{r(t)+1:t\\in T\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\land s\\neq t\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(u\\neq s\\land u\\neq t\\land\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\land\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T)\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}rank\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2RankGame}_S(r,T,\\prec_T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}(T,\\prec_T)\\land\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(\\{\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\},T)\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,T,\\alpha)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(r(s)=\\sup\\{r(t)+1:t\\in T\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\land s\\neq t\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(u\\neq s\\land u\\neq t\\land\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\land\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T)\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The converse tree order is required to be well founded, exactly the condition needed for the successor-rank recursion; its relation and carrier are explicit.</li>\n<li>The equality with the successor-rank supremum defines the canonical well-founded rank, not merely an arbitrary decreasing labelling.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T,\\prec_T)$ (well-founded game tree; see [[58-df-tree]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(T,\\prec_T)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tree},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RankGame}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}rank\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2RankGame}_S(r,T,\\prec_T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}(T,\\prec_T)\\land\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(\\{\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\},T)\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,T,\\alpha)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(r(s)=\\sup\\{r(t)+1:t\\in T\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\land s\\neq t\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(u\\neq s\\land u\\neq t\\land\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\prec_T\\land\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in\\prec_T)\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1540,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-game2-rank-game.md|58-df-zfc-game2-rank-game]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","f06e57c5c0b1354d","36d7463d215be751","9e70b896da231f4f"]}